A. Commit message:
Backport blk-mq.c changes to improve request handling and statistics tracking

B. Change summary:
This patch backports several improvements from the newer version of `blk-mq.c` to enhance request handling, improve statistics tracking, and ensure proper synchronization with CPU hotplug events. Key changes include adding a mutex for CPU hotplug synchronization, updating request initialization, and refining request queue management.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium: Code diff will be applied and a pull request will be sent to the developer to merge, but there are no indirect changes expected to be done in other parts of the system.

D. Fixed Code:
```diff
